OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome
OL,6,Fbrightness further south to end the
OL,7,Fday, but a band of cloud and rain will
OL,8,Fsoon arrive across the region from the
OL,9,Fnorth, some heavier bursts possible.
OL,10,FWinds becoming gusty for a time. Rain
OL,11,Fclearing southwards towards dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FA cloudy start to the day,
OL,14,Fbut cloud breaking through the morning
OL,15,Fwith sunny spells. Scattered showers
OL,16,Farriving from the northwest during the
OL,17,Fday. Feeling fresher than recent days.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
